@startuml DCD-01c
title DCD-01c - Diagrama de clases de diseño: modelo (3/5) -\ncontenido de las canciones

' Continuación de DCD-01a/b (Song se detalla en DCD-01a; Instrument en DCD-01b;
' LessonSection, con Lesson, en DCD-01b).
' Fuentes: model/SongLesson.java, Chord.java, TabSection.java, LessonSection.java, Tune.java,
'          utils/EntityResolver.java (resolveChords)
'
' Notas de diseño:
'   - IDs asignados a mano (data/*.json) en Chord, SongLesson y Tune; IDENTITY en
'     LessonSection y TabSection.
'   - List solo cuando el orden es parte del dato (Lesson.sections, SongLesson.tabSections,
'     Chord.notes, Tune.notes); el resto, Set.
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam roundcorner 6
skinparam nodesep 20
skinparam ranksep 50
skinparam class {
    BackgroundColor<<entity>> #FFF4E0
    BorderColor<<entity>> #B07A1F
    BackgroundColor<<enum>> #F3F3F3
    BackgroundColor<<interface>> #E3F0FF
    BorderColor<<interface>> #3D6FA8
}
hide empty members

interface "Identifiable<ID>" as Identifiable <<interface>>
class Song <<entity>> <<ver DCD-01a>>
class Instrument <<entity>> <<ver DCD-01b>>

class SongLesson <<entity>> {
    - id : Long {PK, asignado}
    - difficulty : SongLesson.DifficultyLevel
    - chordedLyrics : String
    - videoUrl : String
    --
    + equals(o : Object) : boolean
    + hashCode() : int
}

enum "SongLesson.DifficultyLevel" as DifficultyLevel <<enum>> {
    EASY
    MEDIUM
    ORIGINAL
    --
    + {static} from(value : String) : DifficultyLevel
}

class Chord <<entity>> {
    - id : Long {PK, asignado}
    - name : String {unique (name, instrument)}
    - notes : List<String>
    - imageUrl : String
    - open : boolean
    - barre : boolean
    - powerChord : boolean
    - minor : boolean
    - major : boolean
    - seventh : boolean
    - capo : boolean
    - capoFret : int
    --
    + equals(o : Object) : boolean
    + hashCode() : int
}

class TabSection <<entity>> {
    - id : Long {PK}
    - identifier : String
    - content : String
}


class Tune <<entity>> {
    + {static} NOTE_PATTERN : String = "^[A-G]#?[0-8]$"
    - id : Long {PK, asignado}
    - title : String
    - notes : List<String> {@OrderColumn string_index}
    --
    + equals(o : Object) : boolean
    + hashCode() : int
}

Identifiable <|.. Chord
Identifiable <|.. SongLesson
Identifiable <|.. Tune
SongLesson --> DifficultyLevel

Song "1" *-- "*" SongLesson : lessons\n{Set, @OrderBy id}
SongLesson "*" --> "*" Chord : chords\n{Set, @OrderBy id}
SongLesson "1" *-- "*" TabSection : tabSections\n{List}
SongLesson "*" --> "1" Instrument : instrument\n{@NotNull}
Chord "*" --> "1" Instrument : instrument
note top of Chord
  Los chords de una
  SongLesson deben ser
  de su instrument
  (EntityResolver.
  resolveChords(ids,
  instrument), 400 si no).
end note
Tune "*" --> "1" Instrument : instrument

' Solo para colocar Tune debajo del enum (si no, el diagrama es demasiado ancho)
DifficultyLevel -[hidden]down- Tune

@enduml
